  "sourceBlocks": {
    "Baa6d71b28c8d8408": "Eyelib GPU 调试 (RenderDoc)",
    "Bb12092aaf837d94c": "RenderDoc v1.44，路径 `E:\\RenderDoc\\renderdoccmd.exe`。",
    "B3f22c2d8bd22a412": "已知可用路径",
    "Bf9c784fd412ded57": "| 路径 | 状态 |\n|---|---|\n| `renderdoccmd capture gradlew.bat` | ❌ Gradle 代理丢失，TLS 握手失败 |\n| `renderdoccmd capture runClient.cmd` | ✅ 全链路验证通过 |\n| `renderdoccmd inject --PID=<pid>` | ❌ DLL 加载但 endCapture() 失败 |\n| `RenderDocCapturer` 程序化触发 | ✅ startCapture() + endCapture() 返回 true |",
    "B7081939928f98feb": "capture 模式启动",
    "Bdbae3fd967e94a9b": "```powershell\nSet-Location E:\\_ideaProjects\\qylEyelib\n# AIDebugServer 默认不开启：capture 前向 VM 参数文件追加调试端口\nAdd-Content versions\\1.20.1\\build\\moddev\\clientRunVmArgs.txt \"`n-Dai_debug_port=25999\"\n& \"E:\\RenderDoc\\renderdoccmd.exe\" capture `\n    -c eyelib_capture --opt-hook-children `\n    \"E:\\_ideaProjects\\qylEyelib\\versions\\1.20.1\\build\\moddev\\runClient.cmd\"\n```",
    "B27a96361da230f1f": "**前置**: `versions/<node>/build/moddev/runClient.cmd` 需先由 `createClientLaunchScript` 生成(经 `mcmcp_build`)。",
    "B4502b41c5a3e6cca": "普通调试启动用 `mcmcp_launch()`（omp 拓展工具），自动经环境变量注入调试端口。",
    "B3d3955ce6d566ef8": "renderdoccmd CLI 限制",
    "B3e01802e96980f1c": "`renderdoccmd` CLI 只能操作嵌入式数据段（thumb、extract、convert）——**不能分析帧内的 draw call、shader、pipeline state、uniform 值**。截帧后必须用 RenderDoc Python 重放 API 才能做深度分析。",
    "B0c4ef6a4f80bca02": "缩略图（仅预览，无 alpha）:",
    "Bb5be07bce81b083e": "```powershell\n& \"E:\\RenderDoc\\renderdoccmd.exe\" thumb --out snapshot.png --format png capture.rdc\n```",
    "B6a81dcb63bb18a04": "RenderDoc Python replay — Windows 方案（已验证）",
    "B88562004fe4a8032": "唯一可行路径: Windows 侧 Python(WSL 下 GLES 3.x 不支持 replay)。",
    "Ba19f14b46a18cc16": "安装 Python 3.13：`winget install Python.Python.3.13`",
    "B72f28fa113b5e4d7": "安装 renderdoc-mcp：`C:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Local\\Programs\\Python\\Python313\\python.exe -m pip install renderdoc-mcp`",
    "B08c3fb29d96cac8f": "renderdoc-mcp 的 lib 目录下有 `renderdoc.pyd`，导入路径：",
    "Bc3aa66ad13deac13": "```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Local\\Programs\\Python\\Python313\\Lib\\site-packages\\renderdoc_mcp\\lib\")\nimport renderdoc as rd\n```",
    "Bdf2a8433f6afd70d": "API 差异（renderdoc-mcp 0.2.7 vs RenderDoc 原生）：",
    "B727eff17d55b5f85": "`cap.OpenCapture(opts, None)` 返回 `(result, controller)` 元组",
    "B3057ea3df8da803b": "controller 方法：`GetRootActions()`, `GetPostVSData()`, `SetFrameEvent()`, `GetFrameInfo()`",
    "B2ec399f280b4c81c": "Action 属性：`eventId`, `flags`, `children`, `numIndices`, `numInstances`",
    "B4681bad6848a25cc": "Vertex data 通过 `ctrl.GetPostVSData(0, 0, rd.MeshDataStage.VSOut)` 获取",
    "B2c11608df8531403": "调用 Python 脚本: `& \"C:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Local\\Programs\\Python\\Python313\\python.exe\" E:\\path\\to\\script.py`",
    "Bd6efd3e53d7daa4b": "先 `write_file` 写 Python 脚本再调用,避免 shell 转义",
    "B7bcc05cf714a53fd": "renderdoc-mcp：Headless .rdc 分析",
    "B1ea7fab6c1ca545c": "[renderdoc-mcp](https://pypi.org/project/renderdoc-mcp/) 捆绑 renderdoc.so，通过 MCP 协议提供 42 个 headless 分析工具，无需 GUI。",
    "B5a313dce19ac8380": "已在 opencode 的 `mcp_servers.renderdoc` 中配置，工具以 `mcp_renderdoc_*` 前缀注册。",
    "B3709c1c7d014e6a1": "核心工具：`open_capture`、`get_frame_overview`、`list_actions`、`find_draws`、`get_draw_call_state`、`get_pipeline_state`、`disassemble_shader`、`save_texture`、`export_mesh`、`pixel_history`。",
    "B36eecaede42e7527": "⚠️ **WSL 下 GLES 3.x 抓帧无法回放**。唯一可行路径：Windows 侧 Python replay。",
    "B94421e5f9fa7d621": "RenderDocCapturer API",
    "B012a25654542b53f": "`io.github.tt432.clientsmoke.debug.RenderDocCapturer`（clientsmoke mod 内，经 /eval 调用）：",
    "B44cffbb21e218108": "```java\nRenderDocCapturer.isAvailable()          // boolean\nRenderDocCapturer.setCaptureFilePathTemplate(\"E:\\\\...\\\\run\\\\frame\")\nRenderDocCapturer.startCapture()         // void\nRenderDocCapturer.endCapture()           // boolean\n```"
  },
